  {
   "text": "The Berlin Wall opened after an announcement came too early.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.28
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke live on East German television, 9 November 1989.",
   "start": 4.96,
   "end": 9.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Spokesman G\u00fcnter Schabowski had just been handed a note.",
   "start": 10.02,
   "end": 13.32
  },
  {
   "text": "Asked when it began, he said: immediately, without delay.",
   "start": 14.12,
   "end": 17.84
  },
  {
   "text": "West German news told viewers the borders were open.",
   "start": 18.8,
   "end": 21.66
  },
  {
   "text": "That night, guards at Bornholmer Stra\u00dfe let people through.",
   "start": 22.62,
   "end": 26.2
  },
  {
   "text": "One unprepared answer opened the checkpoints.",
   "start": 26.2,
   "end": 29.94
  }
